# libciclops

Engine library for Ciclop-style DIY laser scanning: serial turntable (`Board`), USB webcam via OpenCV (`CameraUsb`), and related helpers.

Install as an optional dependency of ferret-scan:

```bash
uv sync --extra diy
```

Python import name: `ciclops` (distribution name: `libciclops`).
